						<name>The Sect</name>
						<adjective>Neo-Mormon</adjective>
						<memberName>Neo-Mormon</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Holy Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Holy Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>In an old universe of strife, &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt; whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. The believers went forth and conquered, burned, and raped for a thousand years, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt;'s grief at their depravity consumed her. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;God&lt;/color&gt;.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>In an old universe of strife, %%deity0_name%% whipped up great fire that swept away the last age, and brought forth a new one. The believers went forth and conquered, burned, and raped for a thousand years, and %%deity0_name%%'s grief at their depravity consumed %%deity0_objective%%. The unclean, tattooed, pierced, and modified were cast into the ocean by %%deity0_name%%.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
