						<id>4</id>
						<development IsNull="True" />
					</li>
					<li>
						<foundation Class="IdeoFoundation_Deity">
							<def>Deity</def>
							<place>Bagua5</place>
							<deities>
								<li>
									<name>Al-Qahar</name>
									<type>Omnipotent God</type>
									<gender>Female</gender>
									<iconPath>UI/Deities/DeityGeneric</iconPath>
									<relatedMeme>Structure_OriginIslamic</relatedMeme>
								</li>
							</deities>
						</foundation>
						<name>High Crypt</name>
						<adjective>Hemo-Surfrist</adjective>
						<memberName>Hemo-Surfist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Grand Chief</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>On the junkyard planet Bagua 5, during the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Mourning of Al-Qahar&lt;/color&gt;, people would come to the &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Perfect Emblem&lt;/color&gt; at the mosque of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Al-Qahar&lt;/color&gt; and pray with truth in their hearts. A junk lord declared that all who drank blood were abominations, and sent metal-heads to persecute the Hemo-Surfists. &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Al-Qahar&lt;/color&gt; blessed a guard named Breixo Mantis with great charisma, and none could turn away when she spoke. Breixo destroyed the capital of Bagua 5 with an archotech mass-inverter, killing the junk lord. She took her place as ruler of Bagua 5 - and the universe beyond.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>On the junkyard planet Bagua 5, during the %%ritual0_name%%, people would come to the %%altar0_name%% at the %%altarRoomLabel%% of %%deity0_name%% and pray with truth in their hearts. A junk lord declared that all who drank blood were abominations, and sent metal-heads to persecute the %%memberNamePlural%%. %%Deity0_name%% blessed a guard named Breixo Mantis with great charisma, and none could turn away when she spoke. Breixo destroyed the capital of Bagua 5 with an archotech mass-inverter, killing the junk lord. She took her place as ruler of Bagua 5 - and the universe beyond.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Corunan</culture>
						<iconDef>TribalB</iconDef>
						<colorDef>Sapphire</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.850, 0.221, 0.221, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_OriginIslamic</li>
							<li>Supremacist</li>
							<li>Proselytizer</li>
							<li>Bloodfeeding</li>
						</memes>
						<precepts>
							<li>
								<name>slavery</name>
								<def>Slavery_Honorable</def>
								<ID>255</ID>
								<randomSeed>934492654</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li>
								<name>cannibalism</name>
								<def>Cannibalism_Preferred</def>
								<ID>256</ID>
								<randomSeed>379486128</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
							</li>
							<li Class="Precept_Ritual">
								<name>Mourning of Al-Qahar</name>
								<def>Funeral</def>
								<ID>257</ID>
								<randomSeed>1260907549</randomSeed>
								<usesDefiniteArticle>True</usesDefiniteArticle>
								<nameMaker>NamerRitualFuneral</nameMaker>
								<ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>True</ritualOnlyForIdeoMembers>
								<ritualExpectedDesc>You can hold a {IDEOLIGION_adjective} funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDesc>
								<ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>You can hold a funeral for {PAWN_nameDef}.</ritualExpectedDescNoAdjective>
								<playsIdeoMusic>True</playsIdeoMusic>
								<generatedAttachedReward>True</generatedAttachedReward>
								<sourcePattern>FuneralStandard</sourcePattern>
								<obligationTargetFilter Class="RitualObligationTargetWorker_GraveWithTarget">
									<def>GraveWithTargetsCorpse</def>
									<parent>Precept_257</parent>
								</obligationTargetFilter>
								<targetFilter IsNull="True" />
								<behavior Class="RitualBehaviorWorker_Funeral">
									<def>Funeral</def>
								</behavior>
								<triggers>
									<li Class="RitualObligationTrigger_MemberDied">
										<mustBePlayerIdeo>True</mustBePlayerIdeo>
									</li>
								</triggers>
								<outcomeEffect Class="RitualOutcomeEffectWorker_FromQuality">
									<def>AttendedFuneral</def>
									<compDatas>
										<li IsNull="True" />
										<li Class="RitualOutcomeComp_DataThingPresence">
											<presentForTicks>
												<keys />
												<values />
