						<name>Prime Sect</name>
						<adjective>Tedeuteusic</adjective>
						<memberName>Tedeuteusist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>First Fist</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>First Fist</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>&lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tedeuteus&lt;/color&gt; gave wisdom to women, that they may guide and harmonize the excitable men and children, and admonished those who upset this divine order. The women believers, finding themselves abused by the depraved men, fought them, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tedeuteus&lt;/color&gt; gave them divine aid, and they rose to their rightful place. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Tedeuteus&lt;/color&gt; said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>%%Deity0_name%% gave wisdom to women, that they may guide and harmonize the excitable men and children, and admonished those who upset this divine order. The women believers, finding themselves abused by the depraved men, fought them, and %%deity0_name%% gave them divine aid, and they rose to their rightful place. The faithful fought the unbelievers, and %%deity0_name%% said, "Fight them, everywhere, in my name, until I am worshipped throughout the universe and the true peace may finally reign."</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Rustican</culture>
						<iconDef>Dotcircle</iconDef>
						<colorDef>DarkTeal</colorDef>
						<primaryFactionColor>RGBA(0.483, 0.702, 0.985, 1.000)</primaryFactionColor>
						<memes>
							<li>Structure_TheistEmbodied</li>
							<li>FemaleSupremacy</li>
