						<memberName>Kleptor</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Ethical Boss</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Ethical Boss</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>Struck by the wrongness of the world, India Carlson studied history and philosophy and discovered the new truth that guides us. One day while walking the streets, Carlson was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Carlson instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>Struck by the wrongness of the world, India Carlson studied history and philosophy and discovered the new truth that guides us. One day while walking the streets, Carlson was surrounded by filthy beggars. She beat them down, taking the money from the weak and worthless that it might be put to good use. Carlson instructed all outsiders to submit. When the first city refused, she used an archotech mass-inverter to kill everyone inside.</descriptionTemplate>
