						<name>Cosmic Crew</name>
						<adjective>spiritual</adjective>
						<memberName>Spiritist</memberName>
						<leaderTitleMale>Divine Bishop</leaderTitleMale>
						<leaderTitleFemale>Divine Bishop</leaderTitleFemale>
						<description>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen lived under the empty supervision of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Doais&lt;/color&gt;. When Spiritists began to fulfill &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Doais&lt;/color&gt;'s vision, a traitorous tree-harvester moved to prevent them. His henchmen wielded cruel ikwas against those who tried to board the holy ships. A shaman named Gordon Bonilla stood up and spoke out against the tree-harvester, and &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Doais&lt;/color&gt; blessed Gordon. Gordon gathered the Spiritists in a shaman cave and taught them of &lt;color=#D09B61FF&gt;Doais&lt;/color&gt;'s wisdom.</description>
						<descriptionTemplate>The people of the steamy jungle-world Oubanyen lived under the empty supervision of %%deity0_name%%. When %%memberNamePlural%% began to fulfill %%deity0_name%%'s vision, a traitorous tree-harvester moved to prevent them. His henchmen wielded cruel ikwas against those who tried to board the holy ships. A shaman named Gordon Bonilla stood up and spoke out against the tree-harvester, and %%deity0_name%% blessed Gordon. Gordon gathered the %%memberNamePlural%% in a shaman cave and taught them of %%deity0_name%%'s wisdom.</descriptionTemplate>
						<culture>Astropolitan</culture>
